0 Vector - three-axis parallel Delta robot
0 Name: vector-delta.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/vector-delta.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // Original Vector design assembled with OpenAI assistance.
0 // New native PlacedModel exported by the unchanged Brickwright serializeModel function.
0 // Application Author is the native serializer default; design provenance is stated above.
0 // Stock parts, three base-mounted motors, six ball-jointed lower links, common tool head.
0 // No custom constraints, collision edits or scripted output poses.
0 // Companion: vector-delta.bw. Robot Lab Plain; open model, then Code > To blocks.
0 // Reset the complete model before running and before repeating the demonstration.
0 // Physical hardware construction remains untested.
